Samples for XLSXClass.prg

  XLSXWriter.prg  - values of all types, styles, header and footer, merged cells, a picture, two sheets -> sample.xlsx
  XLSXReader.prg  - reads sample.xlsx: sheet names, values, dates, formulas, ranges, merged cells (run xlsxwriter first)
  XLSXReport.prg  - printable report: title, table header, number / date / percent formats, totals with formulas, page setup -> report.xlsx
  XLSXChart.prg   - column, line, horizontal bar and pie charts -> charts.xlsx

Build all samples: build.bat (Windows) or ./build.sh (Linux); hbmk2 options
are passed on, e.g. build -comp=bcc. Or one by one:
  hbmk2 xlsxwriter.hbp
  hbmk2 xlsxreader.hbp
  hbmk2 xlsxreport.hbp
  hbmk2 xlsxchart.hbp
